# The English words of the sign-in pages: one message per `Msg` of
# `src/locale/sign_in.rs`, in the order of their ids.

basic-divider = or, on this development deployment
documentation = Documentation
privacy-notice = Privacy notice
read-without = Read without signing in
read-without-line = Every screen is open to read.
sign-in-caption = The gallery of the FerroHEALTH consoles. It holds no clinical data.
sign-in-note = You sign in at your organisation's identity provider; the gallery never sees your password.
sign-in-taking = Taking you to FerroHEALTH ID…
sign-in-title = Sign in to the gallery
sign-in-with = Sign in with FerroHEALTH ID
state-expired = Your session ended after 30 minutes without a request. Sign in again to go on.
state-full = The gallery holds as many sessions as it allows, so it cannot start yours. Try again in a few minutes; sessions end after 30 minutes without a request.
state-locked = Sign-in is paused for this username after 5 failed tries. Try again later, or sign in with FerroHEALTH ID.
state-provider-unreachable = The gallery could not reach FerroHEALTH ID. Try again in a moment; it may be down.
state-redirecting = You come back here once you are signed in.
state-refused = Not signed in: the sign-in could not be completed at FerroHEALTH ID. Try again; if it keeps failing, the provider may be down.
state-refused-detail = The gallery could not exchange the code for tokens (502).
state-rejected = Not signed in: FerroHEALTH ID did not sign you in, so nothing was kept. If it keeps happening, ask your provider's administrator.
state-rejected-detail = For the administrator: the ID token did not pass the gallery's checks (401).
state-signed-out = You are signed out of the gallery and of FerroHEALTH ID.
state-unavailable = Sign-in is not set up yet. Whoever runs the gallery adds an identity provider to its configuration file.
state-unavailable-detail = No [oidc] section in the configuration file (503).
state-upstream = The server behind the gallery did not answer. You can still try to sign in.
state-wrong = Not signed in: the username or the password is wrong.
state-wrong-tries = 4 tries are left before a 15-minute pause.
